    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18659" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fossĭo</span></b> , ōnis,
			f.
		fodio, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a digging</i> (rare but class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">recenti fossione terram fumare calentem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					N. D. 2, 9, 25</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Col. 11, 2, 41</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 17,
				26, 39, § 247</span></i>.—In
			plur.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quid fossiones agri repastinationesque
					proferam?</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. de Sen. 15, 53</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>a ditch</i>, <i><span class="en">Vitr. 8, 1,
				5</span></i>.</div>
